## Troubleshooting

| Problem | Fix |
|---|---|
| Only Q4_K_M / Q6_K / Q8_0 shown | Search the HF repo name directly (see above) |
| Speed suddenly dropped (~39 → ~17 tok/s) | Fully quit and reopen LM Studio |
| Slow even with a small quant | Check GPU offload in model settings: all layers should be on the GPU for a dense model |

---

## Takeaways

1. AMD + Vulkan in LM Studio works.
2. Dense models want to fit entirely in VRAM. MoE models are more forgiving.
3. Don't settle for the default quant list. Go to the Hugging Face repo.
4. Tune speculative decoding. The best setting isn't always the highest one.

